CHAPTER.VERS:
Go

          {+}
        , inquire of Yahweh for me, and for the people, and for all Judah, concerning the words of this book that was found; for great is the wrath of Yahweh that is kindled against us, because our fathers haven't listened to the words of this book, to do according to all that which is written concerning us.

And she said to them, This is what Yahweh, the God of Israel, says: Tell

          {+}
         the man who sent you

          {+}
         to me,

But to the king of Judah, who sent you

          {+}
         to inquire of Yahweh, thus you

          {+}
         will say to him, This is what Yahweh, the God of Israel, says: As concerning the words which you have heard,
